<node id="F001">
  <data key="d2">The toolchain</data>
  <data key="d3">practitioner_essay</data>
  <data key="d4">F</data>
  <data key="d5">Birgitta Böckeler</data>
  <data key="d6">["Birgitta Böckeler"]</data>
  <data key="d7">2023-07-26</data>
  <data key="d8">Dated entry on the supplied series index; article date also used where printed</data>
  <data key="d9">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai/01-tool-landscape.html</data>
  <data key="d10">martinfowler.com</data>
  <data key="d11">Exploring Generative AI</data>
  <data key="d12">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Organizes coding-assistance tools by task, interaction style, prompt construction and model or hosting choices. The framework helps separate what a tool does from how a developer supplies its context.</data>
  <data key="d15">A July 2023 conceptual landscape, not a comparative benchmark or a current product inventory.</data>
  <data key="d16">Conceptual tool taxonomy</data>
  <data key="d17">Body: task and interaction categories; prompt composition; models and hosting</data>
  <data key="d18">Primary article byline and selected body passages inspected; no independent execution or statistical replication</data>
