  <data key="d12">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Examines three generated median implementations and the defects or side effects that a knowledgeable developer must recognize. The example makes the choice of test expectations part of the engineering work.</data>
  <data key="d15">One small TypeScript example; neither defect prevalence nor a general model-quality comparison was established.</data>
  <data key="d16">Worked programming example</data>
