  <data key="d12">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Explores assistance during red, green and refactor steps. Human test intent and assertions remain important; suggestions can help implementation while also overproducing code or struggling with refactoring.</data>
  <data key="d15">Experience with a human-led workflow and an early tool generation; not evidence about fully autonomous TDD or a causal quality gain.</data>
