  <data key="d12">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Recounts work on an unfamiliar Bahmni/OpenMRS issue. AI helped with terminology and code navigation, but environment setup, fixtures and mocking remained obstacles, and the issue was not solved in the attempt.</data>
  <data key="d15">One exploratory onboarding attempt; no measured reduction in onboarding time or demonstrated long-term comprehension.</data>
  <data key="d16">Exploratory case report</data>
  <data key="d17">Body: issue exploration, code search, environment and testing attempts</data>
