  <data key="d12">https://martinfowler.com/articles/exploring-gen-ai.html</data>
  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Builds a tool-using agent to migrate tests from Enzyme to React Testing Library. The account exposes file-editing, test-feedback and context-management problems alongside successful transformations.</data>
  <data key="d15">A bounded migration experiment with substantial failures; not proof of reliable autonomous migration across a codebase.</data>
  <data key="d16">Exploratory implementation experiment</data>
  <data key="d17">Body: manually solved baseline, agent setup and migration observations</data>
