  <data key="d13">2026-10-13</data>
  <data key="d14">Compares development with and without a behavioral harness against a separate acceptance suite. On the selected service, the stronger model passed both conditions; a cost-optimized model passed more consistently with harness feedback, at greater per-attempt effort.</data>
  <data key="d15">Ten paired runs per model on one unusually detailed greenfield Java brief. Guides and sensors changed together; estimated generation costs omit harness authoring, review and repairs. Final-gate-only use is proposed, not tested.</data>
  <data key="d16">Small repeated-run implementation experiment</data>
